Accelerator note
----------------
kaggle CLI 2.2.4 still *reads* "enable_gpu" from kernel-metadata.json, but the
server keys off "machine_shape" / --accelerator. Version 1 of this kernel was
pushed with only enable_gpu:true and ran on a CPU-only worker: nvidia-smi did
not exist and the first cell died with FileNotFoundError.

Push with the flag, or keep machine_shape in the metadata:

    kaggle kernels push -p kaggle --accelerator gpuT4x2
